                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "938d35d4-d65f-3f6d-9500-6abf5570f43d",
                        "entry_id": "6eee8de2-6231-3e1d-8090-68136560a8e8",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A fan of the American hip hop group Insane Clown Posse."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "slang"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "37db6d12-23e6-4097-b5e1-239ac46cf2fe",
                                "sense_id": "938d35d4-d65f-3f6d-9500-6abf5570f43d",
                                "text": "My Juggalos, family, people who mean a lot to me, everyone. I owe a lotta people for getting through the last few years. You should know who you are."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c05646f6-0508-43ee-9054-e29802b8447a",
                                "sense_id": "938d35d4-d65f-3f6d-9500-6abf5570f43d",
                                "text": "Yes, it's true that the Insane Clown Posse are back with their fifth proper album (or, in juggalo parlance, the fifth joker card)..."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "427ed547-b54b-4d20-b635-ff70a1dc4d07",
                                "sense_id": "938d35d4-d65f-3f6d-9500-6abf5570f43d",
                                "text": "\"And don't tell me your name is Violent J, or Shaggy 2 Dope. Cause you don't look like any Juggalo I've ever seen.\" He laughed out loud throwing his head back."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f28b24cd-0341-4c0c-b32c-cad251b94aaf",
                                "sense_id": "938d35d4-d65f-3f6d-9500-6abf5570f43d",
                                "text": "This book was written for Juggalos by a Juggalo. I highly doubt anybody else would ever get the humor within these pages."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "5b4e37b7-a68f-49ef-8142-eb0856608aad",
                                "sense_id": "938d35d4-d65f-3f6d-9500-6abf5570f43d",
                                "text": "One time, one band on stage tried to get the fans on one side to yell, \"Fuck you\" to the other side, but these people were all Juggalos."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4e65de41-1e58-4f2f-a761-547d83b3b4a8",
                                "sense_id": "938d35d4-d65f-3f6d-9500-6abf5570f43d",
                                "text": "And it was more of an excuse to show an ICP concert DVD and play a bunch of Juggalo music in a school setting a ^([sic]) not get in trouble for it than anything else..."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
